msgstr "Withdrawal request received – Order #%s"

#: includes/class-euwb-emails.php:106
msgid "Richiesta di recesso ricevuta"
msgstr "Withdrawal request received"

#: includes/class-euwb-emails.php:107 includes/class-euwb-emails.php:167
#, php-format
msgid "Gentile %s,"
msgstr "Dear %s,"

#: includes/class-euwb-emails.php:108
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Abbiamo ricevuto la tua richiesta di recesso relativa all'ordine #%1$s, "
"inviata il %2$s, ai sensi dell'Art. 11a della Direttiva UE 2023/2673 (che "
"modifica la Direttiva 2011/83/UE sui diritti dei consumatori)."
msgstr ""
"We have received your withdrawal request relating to order #%1$s, sent on "
"%2$s, pursuant to Art. 11a of EU Directive 2023/2673 (amending Directive "
"2011/83/EU on consumer rights)."

#: includes/class-euwb-emails.php:109
msgid ""
